# Smoke test: Level Builder phase 3 move-mode flow
# Enter Development Move Mode, move freely with no collisions, return to play, then reset.
wait startup
wait 250

press ENTER
wait 150

keydown D
wait 350
keydown W
wait 350
keyup W
wait 150
keydown S
wait 250
keyup S
keyup D
wait 200

press E
wait 120
press Q
wait 120

press ENTER
wait 150

keydown D
wait 1100
press SPACE
wait 900
keyup D
wait 250

press R
wait 250

exit